{"id":"reference/switch","kind":"langref","title":"switch","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#switch","file":"reference/switch.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"switch","text":"switch"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Exhaustive-Switching","text":"穷尽匹配"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Switching-with-Enum-Literals","text":"使用枚举字面量进行匹配"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Switching-on-Errors","text":"匹配错误"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Labeled-switch","text":"带标签的 switch"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Inline-Switch-Prongs","text":"内联 switch 分支"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"switch\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#switch\">switch</a></h2>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> builtin = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"builtin\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch simple\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> a: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> zz: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">103</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// switch 表达式的全部分支都必须能够强制转换为</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 同一种公共类型。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 分支不能贯穿。如果需要贯穿行为，应合并</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 匹配项并使用 if。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> b = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (a) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以通过 ',' 合并多个匹配项</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以使用 ... 语法指定范围，范围包含</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 两端的值。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>...<span class=\"tok-number\">100</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 分支可以任意复杂。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">101</span> =&gt; blk: {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> c: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk c * <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> + <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        },\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 允许匹配任意表达式，前提是</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 表达式在编译时已知。</span>\n        zz =&gt; zz,\n        blk: {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> d: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> e: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk d + e;\n        } =&gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">107</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// else 分支匹配此前未捕获的所有值。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 除非已处理整个值域，</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 否则必须提供 else 分支。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>,\n    };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, b);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// switch 表达式也可以用于函数外部：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> os_msg = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (builtin.target.os.tag) {\n    .linux =&gt; <span class=\"tok-str\">\"we found a linux user\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-str\">\"not a linux user\"</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 函数内部，如果目标表达式在编译时已知，</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// switch 语句就会隐式在编译时求值。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch inside function\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (builtin.target.os.tag) {\n        .fuchsia =&gt; {\n            <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 在 fuchsia 以外的操作系统中，甚至不会分析此块，</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 因此不会触发这条编译错误。</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 在 fuchsia 上则会触发这条编译错误。</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@compileError</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"fuchsia not supported\"</span>);\n        },\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; {},\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_switch.test.switch simple...OK\n2/2 test_switch.test.switch inside function...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code> 可以捕获<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#Tagged-union\">标记联合</a>的字段值。在捕获变量名称前加上 <code>*</code>，将其变为指针，即可修改字段值。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_tagged_union.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch on tagged union\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Point = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n        x: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n        y: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Item = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>) {\n        a: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>,\n        c: Point,\n        d,\n        e: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>,\n    };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> a = Item{ .c = Point{ .x = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, .y = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span> } };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 允许匹配更复杂的枚举。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> b = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (a) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 匹配时可以使用捕获组，返回匹配到的枚举</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 值。如果两个匹配项的载荷类型相同，</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以把它们放在同一个 switch 分支中。</span>\n        Item.a, Item.e =&gt; |item| item,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以使用 `*` 语法获取匹配值的引用。</span>\n        Item.c =&gt; |*item| blk: {\n            item.*.x += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk <span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>;\n        },\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 如果已穷尽处理所有类型情况，就不需要 else</span>\n        Item.d =&gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>,\n    };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>, b);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, a.c.x);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_tagged_union.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_switch_tagged_union.test.switch on tagged union...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">enum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#compileError\">@compileError</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Compile-Variables/#Compile-Variables\">编译变量</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n      <h3 id=\"Exhaustive-Switching\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#Exhaustive-Switching\">穷尽匹配</a></h3>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code> 表达式没有 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 子句时，必须穷尽列出全部可能的值，否则产生编译错误：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_unhandled_enumeration_value.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Color = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    auto,\n    off,\n    on,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"exhaustive switching\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> color = Color.off;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (color) {\n        Color.auto =&gt; {},\n        Color.on =&gt; {},\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_unhandled_enumeration_value.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_unhandled_enumeration_value.zig:9:5: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">switch must handle all possibilities\n</span>    switch (color) {\n    <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_unhandled_enumeration_value.zig:3:5: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">unhandled enumeration value: 'off'\n</span>    off,\n    <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_unhandled_enumeration_value.zig:1:15: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">enum 'test_unhandled_enumeration_value.Color' declared here\n</span>const Color = enum {\n              <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Switching-with-Enum-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#Switching-with-Enum-Literals\">使用枚举字面量进行匹配</a></h3>\n\n      <p>将<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#Enum-Literals\">枚举字面量</a>与 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code> 结合使用，可以避免重复指定 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">enum</a> 或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#union\">union</a> 类型：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_exhaustive_switch.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Color = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    auto,\n    off,\n    on,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"enum literals with switch\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> color = Color.off;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> result = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (color) {\n        .auto =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        .on =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        .off =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(result);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_exhaustive_switch.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_exhaustive_switch.test.enum literals with switch...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Switching-on-Errors\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#Switching-on-Errors\">匹配错误</a></h3>\n\n      <p>匹配错误时，允许一些特殊情况，以简化泛型编程模式：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_on_errors.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> FileOpenError0 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    AccessDenied,\n    OutOfMemory,\n    FileNotFound,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">openFile0</span>() FileOpenError0 {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OutOfMemory;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"unreachable else prong\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (openFile0()) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.AccessDenied, <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.FileNotFound =&gt; |e| <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> e,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OutOfMemory =&gt; {},\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 'openFile0' 不会返回其他错误，因此编译时可知</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 'else' 分支不可达。不过在这种情况下，添加该分支</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 不会产生“不可达的 else 分支”编译错误：</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 允许的不可达 else 分支有：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//    `else =&gt; unreachable,`</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//    `else =&gt; return,`</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//    `else =&gt; |e| return e,`（其中 `e` 是任意标识符）</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> FileOpenError1 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    AccessDenied,\n    SystemResources,\n    FileNotFound,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">openFile1</span>() FileOpenError1 {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SystemResources;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">openFileGeneric</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> kind: <span class=\"tok-type\">u1</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (kind) {\n    <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> =&gt; FileOpenError0,\n    <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; FileOpenError1,\n} {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (kind) {\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> =&gt; openFile0(),\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; openFile1(),\n    };\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"comptime unreachable errors not in error set\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (openFileGeneric(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>)) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.AccessDenied, <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.FileNotFound =&gt; |e| <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> e,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OutOfMemory =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>, <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 不属于 `FileOpenError1`！</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SystemResources =&gt; {},\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_on_errors.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_switch_on_errors.test.unreachable else prong...OK\n2/2 test_switch_on_errors.test.comptime unreachable errors not in error set...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Labeled-switch\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#Labeled-switch\">带标签的 switch</a></h3>\n\n      <p>为 switch 语句添加标签后，可以通过 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 或 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 引用它。<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code> 会从 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code> 返回一个值。</p>\n      <p>以 switch 为目标的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 必须带有操作数。执行时会跳转到匹配的分支，相当于用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 的操作数替换初始匹配值后重新执行 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code>。</p>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_continue.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch continue\"</span> {\n    sw: <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>)) {\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :sw <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 单个 switch 分支内部可以出现多次 `continue`。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>...<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> =&gt; |v| {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (v &gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) {\n                <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :sw <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n            } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (v == <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) {\n\n                <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `break` 可以指向带标签的循环。</span>\n                <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :sw;\n            }\n\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :sw <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n        },\n\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_continue.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_switch_continue.test.switch continue...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>从语义上说，这等价于以下循环：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_continue_equivalent.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch continue, equivalent loop\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> sw: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (sw) {\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span> =&gt; {\n                sw = <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>;\n                <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span>;\n            },\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>...<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> =&gt; |v| {\n                <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (v &gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) {\n                    sw = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n                    <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span>;\n                } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (v == <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) {\n                    <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span>;\n                }\n\n                sw = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n                <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span>;\n            },\n            <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_continue_equivalent.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_switch_continue_equivalent.test.switch continue, equivalent loop...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>这可以提高状态机等代码的清晰度，因为语法 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :sw .next_state</code> 无歧义、含义明确且易于理解。</p>\n      <p>不过，最初的动机是需要对数组的每个元素执行匹配；此时单个 switch 能同时改善可读性和性能：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_dispatch_loop.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Instruction = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    add,\n    mul,\n    end,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">evaluate</span>(initial_stack: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, code: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Instruction) !<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> buffer: [<span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> stack = std.ArrayList(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>).initBuffer(&amp;buffer);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> stack.appendSliceBounded(initial_stack);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ip: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> vm: <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (code[ip]) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `continue` 之后的所有代码均不可达，因此此分支</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 不提供结果。</span>\n        .add =&gt; {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> stack.appendBounded(stack.pop().? + stack.pop().?);\n\n            ip += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :vm code[ip];\n        },\n        .mul =&gt; {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> stack.appendBounded(stack.pop().? * stack.pop().?);\n\n            ip += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span> :vm code[ip];\n        },\n        .end =&gt; stack.pop().?,\n    };\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"evaluate\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> result = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> evaluate(&amp;.{ <span class=\"tok-number\">7</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, -<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span> }, &amp;.{ .mul, .add, .end });\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, result);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_dispatch_loop.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_switch_dispatch_loop.test.evaluate...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>如果 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 的操作数在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知，就可以将其降低为无条件跳转到对应分支。这种跳转可以被完全预测，因此执行通常很快。</p>\n\n      <p>操作数在运行时已知时，每个 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code> 都可以内嵌条件分支（理想情况下通过跳转表实现），让 CPU 独立预测其目标，而不受其他分支影响。降低为循环则会迫使所有分支经过相同的分派点，妨碍分支预测。</p>\n\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Inline-Switch-Prongs\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#Inline-Switch-Prongs\">内联 switch 分支</a></h3>\n\n      <p>switch 分支可以标记为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code>，针对每个可能值生成一份分支体，使捕获值成为<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>值。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_inline_switch.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectError = std.testing.expectError;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">isFieldOptional</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, field_index: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> field_types = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(T).@\"struct\".field_types;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (field_index) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此分支会分析两次，每次的 `idx` 都是</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 编译时已知值。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; |idx| <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(field_types[idx]) == .optional,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.IndexOutOfBounds,\n    };\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Struct1 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> { a: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, b: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> };\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"using @typeInfo with runtime values\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> index: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!<span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> isFieldOptional(Struct1, index));\n    index += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(<span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> isFieldOptional(Struct1, index));\n    index += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectError(<span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.IndexOutOfBounds, isFieldOptional(Struct1, index));\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对 `Struct1` 调用 `isFieldOptional` 会展开为</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 与以下函数等价的代码：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">isFieldOptionalUnrolled</span>(field_index: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (field_index) {\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.IndexOutOfBounds,\n    };\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_inline_switch.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_inline_switch.test.using @typeInfo with runtime values...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 关键字也可以与范围结合使用：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">inline_prong_range.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">isFieldOptional</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, field_index: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> field_types = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(T).@\"struct\".field_types;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (field_index) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>...field_types.len - <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> =&gt; |idx| <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(field_types[idx]) == .optional,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.IndexOutOfBounds,\n    };\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 分支可以作为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span></code> 循环的一种类型安全替代方案：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_inline_else.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> SliceTypeA = <span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    len: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>,\n    ptr: [*]<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> SliceTypeB = <span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    ptr: [*]SliceTypeA,\n    len: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> AnySlice = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>)) {\n    a: SliceTypeA,\n    b: SliceTypeB,\n    c: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    d: []AnySlice,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">withFor</span>(any: AnySlice) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Tag = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(AnySlice).@\"union\".tag_type.?;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> info = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(Tag).@\"enum\";\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (info.field_names, info.field_values) |field_name, field_value| {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 `inline for` 时，函数生成为</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 一系列 `if` 语句，并依靠优化器</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 将它们转换为 switch。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (field_value == <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(any)) {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@field</span>(any, field_name).len;\n        }\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 `inline for` 时，编译器不知道所有</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可能情况都已处理，因此必须显式写出 `unreachable`。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">withSwitch</span>(any: AnySlice) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (any) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 `inline else` 时，函数会显式生成为</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 所需的 switch，编译器能够检查</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 是否已处理每一种可能情况。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; |slice| slice.len,\n    };\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"inline for and inline else similarity\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> any = AnySlice{ .c = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello\"</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, withFor(any));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, withSwitch(any));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_inline_else.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_inline_else.test.inline for and inline else similarity...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>对联合使用内联匹配分支时，即使载荷仅在运行时已知，也可以通过额外捕获在编译时获取联合的枚举标记值。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_inline_switch_union_tag.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> U = <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>) {\n    a: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>,\n    b: <span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">getNum</span>(u: U) <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (u) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此处 `num` 是运行时已知值，为 `u.a`</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 或 `u.b`；`tag` 则是 `u` 在编译时已知的标记值。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; |num, tag| {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (tag == .b) {\n                <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromFloat</span>(num);\n            }\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> num;\n        },\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"test\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> u = U{ .b = <span class=\"tok-number\">42</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">42</span>, getNum(u));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_inline_switch_union_tag.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_inline_switch_union_tag.test.test...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#inline-while\">inline while</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/for/#inline-for\">inline for</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#Tagged-union\">标记联合</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":92,"translated":92}}
